CM_ SG_ 292 SSMStatus_124h "the states of a start-stop state machine
用于起停状态机的各种状态
0-Reset Start/Stop not active(any engine condition possible)
开关关掉
1-StandbyS/S active, engine off(waiting for initial keybutton start)
默认状态，奇瑞默认上电开启
2- StoppedS/S active, engine standstill
3- Starter RestartSS/ active starter engine is turning 
是指需要通过起动机来启动
4 - Engine RestartS/S active, engine runs up
只是不需要起动机介入就可以自动启动，比如说正在停机过程中，转速还没有到0，驾驶员改变的意图，不想停机了。因为这时候转速还比较高，不需要起动机拖动，直接恢复供油就可以启动了。
5 - OperationS/S active, engine is running
6 - Auto StoppingS/S active, engine is turning but no fuel injection anymore
若无ISS功能，该信号发000";
